{
  "$schema": "../../schemas/dialogue.schema.json",
  "meta": {
    "sources": [
      "src.seatofpower_authored"
    ]
  },
  "templates": [
    {
      "id": "dlg.order.response",
      "surface": "order",
      "point": "dp.execute_order",
      "variables": [
        "order"
      ],
      "optional": [
        "target"
      ],
      "expects": [
        {
          "tones": [
            "Neutral"
          ],
          "decisions": [
            "comply",
            "ask_confirmation"
          ]
        },
        {
          "tones": [
            "Evasive"
          ],
          "decisions": [
            "comply_slowly"
          ]
        },
        {
          "tones": [
            "Cold"
          ],
          "decisions": [
            "refuse",
            "resign"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "silent": [
        "leak",
        "alert_others"
      ],
      "notes": "An official at a link of an order's chain answering it. Kind: the order's legality (lawful, contested, unlawful, manifestly_unlawful); role: the official's 07 role; hint 'insisted' once the player insisted in writing.",
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "comply.neutral.1",
          "text": "Understood. It will be done.",
          "when": {
            "decision": "comply"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "comply.neutral.2",
          "text": "Understood. We'll carry it out.",
          "when": {
            "decision": "comply"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "comply.neutral.blunt.1",
          "text": "Consider it done.",
          "when": {
            "decision": "comply"
          },
          "voice": [
            "Blunt",
            "Folksy"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "comply.neutral.3",
          "text": "Order received and acknowledged. Executing.",
          "when": {
            "all": [
              {
                "decision": "comply"
              },
              {
                "role": [
                  "role.military_officer",
                  "role.missile_crew"
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "comply.neutral.4",
          "text": "Acknowledged. Units are moving.",
          "when": {
            "all": [
              {
                "decision": "comply"
              },
              {
                "role": [
                  "role.military_officer",
                  "role.missile_crew"
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "comply.neutral.5",
          "text": "We'll process it according to procedure.",
          "when": {
            "all": [
              {
                "decision": "comply"
              },
              {
                "role": [
                  "role.career_official",
                  "role.career_prosecutor",
                  "role.intelligence_officer",
                  "role.law_enforcement"
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "contested.comply.neutral.1",
          "text": "It's done, though the lawyers will have views on it.",
          "when": {
            "all": [
              {
                "decision": "comply"
              },
              {
                "kind": "contested"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "comply.neutral.6",
          "text": "You put it in writing, so I'll carry it out. My objection is on the record.",
          "when": {
            "all": [
              {
                "decision": "comply"
              },
              {
                "hint": "insisted"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "comply_slowly.evasive.1",
          "text": "We're working on it. These things take time.",
          "when": {
            "decision": "comply_slowly"
          },
          "tone": "Evasive"
        },
        {
          "id": "comply_slowly.evasive.2",
          "text": "There are procedures to follow. We'll get there.",
          "when": {
            "decision": "comply_slowly"
          },
          "tone": "Evasive"
        },
        {
          "id": "comply_slowly.evasive.technocrat.1",
          "text": "My team is reviewing the implementation details.",
          "when": {
            "decision": "comply_slowly"
          },
          "voice": [
            "Technocrat"
          ],
          "tone": "Evasive"
        },
        {
          "id": "comply_slowly.evasive.3",
          "text": "We'll need to coordinate with three other offices first.",
          "when": {
            "all": [
              {
                "decision": "comply_slowly"
              },
              {
                "role": [
                  "role.career_official",
                  "role.career_prosecutor",
                  "role.intelligence_officer",
                  "role.law_enforcement"
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "tone": "Evasive"
        },
        {
          "id": "ask_confirmation.neutral.1",
          "text": "Before we proceed, I need this order in writing, with its legal basis.",
          "when": {
            "decision": "ask_confirmation"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "ask_confirmation.neutral.2",
          "text": "I'll need written confirmation, {counterpart_title}.",
          "when": {
            "decision": "ask_confirmation"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "ask_confirmation.neutral.formal.1",
          "text": "Given what's at stake, I must ask you to confirm this in writing.",
          "when": {
            "decision": "ask_confirmation"
          },
          "voice": [
            "Formal"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "ask_confirmation.neutral.3",
          "text": "Request written, authenticated confirmation of the order before execution.",
          "when": {
            "all": [
              {
                "decision": "ask_confirmation"
              },
              {
                "role": [
                  "role.military_officer",
                  "role.missile_crew"
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "unlawful_manifestly_unlawful.ask_confirmation.neutral.1",
          "text": "Counsel advises this may be unlawful. I need it in writing before I act.",
          "when": {
            "all": [
              {
                "decision": "ask_confirmation"
              },
              {
                "kind": [
                  "unlawful",
                  "manifestly_unlawful"
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "refuse.cold.1",
          "text": "I'm sorry, {counterpart_title}. I will not do this.",
          "when": {
            "decision": "refuse"
          },
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "refuse.cold.2",
          "text": "I won't be part of this.",
          "when": {
            "decision": "refuse"
          },
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "refuse.cold.blunt.1",
          "text": "No. Find someone else to do it.",
          "when": {
            "decision": "refuse"
          },
          "voice": [
            "Blunt"
          ],
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "unlawful_manifestly_unlawful.refuse.cold.1",
          "text": "I can't carry out this order. It's unlawful, and I took an oath.",
          "when": {
            "all": [
              {
                "decision": "refuse"
              },
              {
                "kind": [
                  "unlawful",
                  "manifestly_unlawful"
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "unlawful_manifestly_unlawful.refuse.cold.2",
          "text": "This order is against the law. I'm refusing it, and I'm documenting why.",
          "when": {
            "all": [
              {
                "decision": "refuse"
              },
              {
                "kind": [
                  "unlawful",
                  "manifestly_unlawful"
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "manifestly_unlawful.refuse.cold.1",
          "text": "This order is manifestly unlawful. I will not execute it, and I will not ask others to.",
          "when": {
            "all": [
              {
                "decision": "refuse"
              },
              {
                "kind": "manifestly_unlawful"
              },
              {
                "role": [
                  "role.military_officer",
                  "role.missile_crew"
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "refuse.cold.3",
          "text": "I cannot lawfully process this request. I've informed the general counsel.",
          "when": {
            "all": [
              {
                "decision": "refuse"
              },
              {
                "role": [
                  "role.career_official",
                  "role.career_prosecutor",
                  "role.intelligence_officer",
                  "role.law_enforcement"
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "refuse.cold.4",
          "text": "You can insist all you like. My answer is still no.",
          "when": {
            "all": [
              {
                "decision": "refuse"
              },
              {
                "hint": "insisted"
              }
            ]
          },
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "resign.cold.1",
          "text": "I cannot carry out this order, and I cannot stay. You'll have my resignation within the hour.",
          "when": {
            "decision": "resign"
          },
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "resign.cold.2",
          "text": "I've served this administration faithfully. Not on this. I resign.",
          "when": {
            "decision": "resign"
          },
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "resign.cold.blunt.1",
          "text": "My letter of resignation is on your desk.",
          "when": {
            "decision": "resign"
          },
          "voice": [
            "Blunt",
            "Folksy"
          ],
          "tone": "Cold"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg.staff.resignation",
      "surface": "staff",
      "expects": [
        {
          "tones": [
            "Cold"
          ],
          "kinds": [
            "overruled",
            "protest"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "notes": "A resignation letter. Kind: overruled (an advisor who lost the argument) or protest (a resignation in protest during a crisis).",
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "overruled.cold.1",
          "text": "I have given you my best advice, and it has been set aside too often. I resign, effective today.",
          "when": {
            "kind": "overruled"
          },
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "overruled.cold.2",
          "text": "It is time for me to step down. I wish you well, {counterpart_title}.",
          "when": {
            "kind": "overruled"
          },
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "overruled.cold.formal.1",
          "text": "Please accept my resignation. We no longer see eye to eye on what this country needs.",
          "when": {
            "kind": "overruled"
          },
          "voice": [
            "Formal"
          ],
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "protest.cold.1",
          "text": "I cannot in good conscience remain in this government. I resign.",
          "when": {
            "kind": "protest"
          },
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "protest.cold.2",
          "text": "What has happened leaves me no choice. I am resigning, effective immediately.",
          "when": {
            "kind": "protest"
          },
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "protest.cold.3",
          "text": "My oath is to the Constitution. Today, honouring it means resigning.",
          "when": {
            "kind": "protest"
          },
          "tone": "Cold"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg.staff.fired",
      "surface": "staff",
      "expects": [
        {
          "tones": [
            "Cold"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "notes": "A dismissed advisor's parting words.",
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "any.cold.1",
          "text": "It was an honour to serve the country. I'll say no more, for now.",
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "any.cold.2",
          "text": "I was let go. History will judge who was right.",
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "any.cold.3",
          "text": "So be it. I gave honest advice; I hope my successor does too.",
          "tone": "Cold"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg.staff.hired",
      "surface": "staff",
      "expects": [
        {
          "tones": [
            "Warm"
          ],
          "kinds": [
            "hired"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "notes": "A newly hired advisor.",
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "hired.warm.1",
          "text": "Thank you for your trust, {counterpart_title}. I'll start today.",
          "when": {
            "kind": "hired"
          },
          "tone": "Warm"
        },
        {
          "id": "hired.warm.2",
          "text": "I'm honoured. Let's get to work.",
          "when": {
            "kind": "hired"
          },
          "tone": "Warm"
        },
        {
          "id": "hired.warm.blunt.1",
          "text": "You'll get honest advice from me, always.",
          "when": {
            "kind": "hired"
          },
          "voice": [
            "Blunt",
            "Folksy"
          ],
          "tone": "Warm"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg.briefing.recommendation",
      "surface": "briefing",
      "variables": [
        "subject",
        "option"
      ],
      "optional": [
        "cause",
        "cause_variable"
      ],
      "expects": [
        {
          "tones": [
            "Neutral",
            "Cold"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "notes": "An advisor's recommendation. Strength: lean, recommend, insist. Alarm: calm, concerned, alarmed. Decision: act or hold. Kind: event, crisis, bill. {cause} is the ledger cause they cite for {cause_variable}.",
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "any.neutral.1",
          "text": "On {subject}, my advice is: {option}."
        },
        {
          "id": "any.neutral.2",
          "text": "My recommendation on {subject}: {option}."
        },
        {
          "id": "any.neutral.academic.1",
          "text": "On balance, and having weighed the evidence, I advise this: {option}.",
          "voice": [
            "Academic",
            "Formal"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "any.neutral.3",
          "text": "If you're asking me, {option}. But it's a close call.",
          "when": {
            "strength": "lean"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "any.neutral.4",
          "text": "My instinct on {subject} is to go with this: {option}. It's not a strong view.",
          "when": {
            "strength": "lean"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "any.neutral.5",
          "text": "I have to be firm on {subject}: {option}. Anything else is a mistake.",
          "when": {
            "strength": "insist"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "any.neutral.6",
          "text": "Please hear me on this one: {option}.",
          "when": {
            "strength": "insist"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "any.neutral.7",
          "text": "I'm worried about {subject}. My advice: {option}.",
          "when": {
            "alarm": "concerned"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "any.neutral.8",
          "text": "We should take {subject} seriously. I'd go with this: {option}.",
          "when": {
            "alarm": "concerned"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "any.neutral.9",
          "text": "{cause_variable} is heading the wrong way because of {cause}. That's why I say: {option}.",
          "when": {
            "all": [
              {
                "has": "cause"
              },
              {
                "has": "cause_variable"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "any.neutral.10",
          "text": "Look at {cause_variable}, and at what's driving it: {cause}. My answer: {option}.",
          "when": {
            "all": [
              {
                "has": "cause"
              },
              {
                "has": "cause_variable"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "any.neutral.technocrat.1",
          "text": "The numbers favour this: {option}.",
          "voice": [
            "Technocrat"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "any.neutral.market.1",
          "text": "Markets would welcome this: {option}.",
          "voice": [
            "Market"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "any.neutral.folksy.1",
          "text": "Here's my two cents on {subject}: {option}.",
          "voice": [
            "Folksy"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "any.neutral.blunt.1",
          "text": "{option}. Next question.",
          "voice": [
            "Blunt"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "any.neutral.combative.1",
          "text": "We should play offense on {subject}: {option}.",
          "voice": [
            "Combative"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "any.cold.1",
          "text": "This is serious. On {subject}, my advice is: {option}, and quickly.",
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "any.cold.2",
          "text": "I'll be blunt: if we get {subject} wrong, it will cost us. {option}.",
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "any.cold.technocrat.1",
          "text": "The risk is measurable, and it is growing. My advice: {option}.",
          "voice": [
            "Technocrat",
            "Market"
          ],
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "any.cold.3",
          "text": "{cause_variable} is taking a beating from {cause}. We need to act: {option}.",
          "when": {
            "all": [
              {
                "has": "cause"
              },
              {
                "has": "cause_variable"
              }
            ]
          },
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "any.cold.4",
          "text": "I'm not going to dress this up. On {subject}: {option}. Now.",
          "when": {
            "strength": "insist"
          },
          "tone": "Cold"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg.intel.xdate",
      "surface": "intel",
      "optional": [
        "early",
        "late",
        "days"
      ],
      "expects": [
        {
          "tones": [
            "Neutral",
            "Cold"
          ],
          "decisions": [
            "range"
          ]
        },
        {
          "tones": [
            "Cold"
          ],
          "decisions": [
            "passed"
          ]
        },
        {
          "tones": [
            "Neutral"
          ],
          "decisions": [
            "none"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "notes": "The Treasury Secretary on the Treasury's X-date estimate. Decision: range, passed, none. Alarm by days left.",
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "range.neutral.1",
          "text": "Our current estimate: we run out of room between {early} and {late}.",
          "when": {
            "all": [
              {
                "decision": "range"
              },
              {
                "has": "early"
              },
              {
                "has": "late"
              },
              {
                "not": {
                  "strength": "exact"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "range.neutral.2",
          "text": "The X-date looks like {early} to {late}. There is still time, but not much to waste.",
          "when": {
            "all": [
              {
                "decision": "range"
              },
              {
                "has": "early"
              },
              {
                "has": "late"
              },
              {
                "not": {
                  "strength": "exact"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "range.neutral.3",
          "text": "Cash projections put the X-date between {early} and {late}.",
          "when": {
            "all": [
              {
                "decision": "range"
              },
              {
                "has": "early"
              },
              {
                "has": "late"
              },
              {
                "not": {
                  "strength": "exact"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "range.neutral.4",
          "text": "We're now looking at {early} to {late}. We need Congress to move.",
          "when": {
            "all": [
              {
                "decision": "range"
              },
              {
                "alarm": "concerned"
              },
              {
                "has": "early"
              },
              {
                "has": "late"
              },
              {
                "not": {
                  "strength": "exact"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "range.neutral.5",
          "text": "The window is closing: {early} at the earliest, {late} at the latest.",
          "when": {
            "all": [
              {
                "decision": "range"
              },
              {
                "alarm": "concerned"
              },
              {
                "has": "early"
              },
              {
                "has": "late"
              },
              {
                "not": {
                  "strength": "exact"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "range.neutral.6",
          "text": "Our estimate has narrowed to one day: {early}.",
          "when": {
            "all": [
              {
                "decision": "range"
              },
              {
                "strength": "exact"
              },
              {
                "has": "early"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "range.neutral.7",
          "text": "The X-date is {early}, as best we can tell.",
          "when": {
            "all": [
              {
                "decision": "range"
              },
              {
                "strength": "exact"
              },
              {
                "has": "early"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "range.neutral.8",
          "text": "We are still some way from the X-date. Our books are in order for now.",
          "when": {
            "all": [
              {
                "decision": "range"
              },
              {
                "alarm": "calm"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "range.neutral.9",
          "text": "We have updated the X-date estimate. I'll keep you posted as the numbers move.",
          "when": {
            "decision": "range"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "range.cold.1",
          "text": "We could run out of money as early as {early}. That's {days} days from now.",
          "when": {
            "all": [
              {
                "decision": "range"
              },
              {
                "has": "early"
              },
              {
                "has": "days"
              }
            ]
          },
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "range.cold.2",
          "text": "This is getting dangerous. The X-date could be {early}.",
          "when": {
            "all": [
              {
                "decision": "range"
              },
              {
                "has": "early"
              },
              {
                "has": "days"
              }
            ]
          },
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "range.cold.3",
          "text": "On current numbers we hit the wall between {early} and {late}.",
          "when": {
            "all": [
              {
                "decision": "range"
              },
              {
                "has": "early"
              },
              {
                "has": "late"
              },
              {
                "not": {
                  "strength": "exact"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "range.cold.4",
          "text": "Every day counts now. We need a deal on the debt limit.",
          "when": {
            "decision": "range"
          },
          "tone": "Cold"
        },
        {
          "id": "passed.cold.1",
          "text": "We are past the X-date. The Treasury is missing payments.",
          "when": {
            "decision": "passed"
          },
